      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Ab simple thing is lets say koi state variable todos\nhumara ToDo App component mein hai aur humne woh \nprops k through ToDo Input Box aur ToDo Display\nmein bhi bhej diya hai . Toh ab for example say \nToDo Input Box mein humne vo state var update \nkrdiya bcoz props k through access toh mil hi gya tha \nSo ab sarre components with that state variable rerender\nhonge i.e, upar ToDo App and also ToDo App k baki child\nbhi rerender honge . \n",
      "fontSize": 27.027366758896918,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Ab simple thing is lets say koi state variable todos\nhumara ToDo App component mein hai aur humne woh \nprops k through ToDo Input Box aur ToDo Display\nmein bhi bhej diya hai . Toh ab for example say \nToDo Input Box mein humne vo state var update \nkrdiya bcoz props k through access toh mil hi gya tha \nSo ab sarre components with that state variable rerender\nhonge i.e, upar ToDo App and also ToDo App k baki child\nbhi rerender honge . \n",
